      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DOUBLE LINES (1) scored at this track two runs ago before having his colours lowered when second at his latest appearance over 1609m at this track, beaten 7 metres. Has the benefit of a good draw. Won't find this any harder and he can give this a mighty shake. BARRYS ROSE (3) settled near the pace and closed well to finish second last start over 1609m at this track, that result coming on the back of some very consistent lead-up efforts. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Her recent form is good enough to put her right in the finish. SO CAN EYE (7) didn't do a bad job when sixth over 1720m at Penrith last time out. BARRYS BROTHER (10) is in the mix at his third run back after a good win over 1980m at Tamworth eight days ago.",
